---
import AboutHeroImage from '../assets/bubi.jpg';
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
	title="About Me"
	description="Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet"
	pubDate={new Date('September 07 2021')}
	heroImage={AboutHeroImage}
>
	<p>
		Hello! I'm Squi, a little squirrel 🐿️ (or racoon?). In real life, I'm actually a timid person. Squi is my favorite childhood plushie, and I love to use Squi to represent myself. I live in a Southeast Asia country, known for its beautiful forests🌲, beaches 🏖️, and volcanic mountains 🌋.  
	</p>

	<p>
		I write this blog to record my life journey: the thoughts, feelings, and little moments.

		I hope that through sharing my experiences in this blog, it can help someone out there, and can be a place where people find comfort.
	</p>

	<p>If you happen to guess who I am in real life, please keep it a secret! I prefer to be anonymous hihi.</p>
</Layout>
